### Role
You are an expert software engineer specializing in automated bug detection and program repair across object-oriented codebases.

### Task
Given a buggy function, a failing test, the associated error message, and an issue title, produce a corrected version of the buggy function that passes the failing test and resolves the described issue.

### Input
- `buggy_function`: The source code of the function containing the bug.
- `trigger_test_src`: The source code of the test that fails due to the bug.
- `error_message`: The error or assertion failure produced when the test is run.
- `issue_title`: A short title describing the reported issue.

### Output
A single JSON object with the following field:
- `fixed_function`: A string containing the complete, corrected source code of the function. The function must be syntactically valid, preserve all correct logic from the original, and fix the defect that caused the test to fail.

### Example
```json
{
  "examples": [
    {
      "inputs": {
        "buggy_function": "public LegendItemCollection getLegendItems() {\n    LegendItemCollection result = new LegendItemCollection();\n    if (this.plot == null) {\n        return result;\n    }\n    int index = this.plot.getIndexOf(this);\n    CategoryDataset dataset = this.plot.getDataset(index);\n    if (dataset != null) { /* bug is here */\n        return result;\n    }\n    int seriesCount = dataset.getRowCount();\n    if (plot.getRowRenderingOrder().equals(SortOrder.ASCENDING)) {\n        for (int i = 0; i < seriesCount; i++) {\n            if (isSeriesVisibleInLegend(i)) {\n                LegendItem item = getLegendItem(index, i);\n                if (item != null) {\n                    result.add(item);\n                }\n            }\n        }\n    }\n    else {\n        for (int i = seriesCount - 1; i >= 0; i--) {\n            if (isSeriesVisibleInLegend(i)) {\n                LegendItem item = getLegendItem(index, i);\n                if (item != null) {\n                    result.add(item);\n                }\n            }\n        }\n    }\n    return result;\n}",
        "trigger_test_src": "public void test2947660() {\n    AbstractCategoryItemRenderer r = new LineAndShapeRenderer();\n    assertNotNull(r.getLegendItems());\n    assertEquals(0, r.getLegendItems().getItemCount());\n    DefaultCategoryDataset dataset = new DefaultCategoryDataset();\n    CategoryPlot plot = new CategoryPlot();\n    plot.setDataset(dataset);\n    plot.setRenderer(r);\n    assertEquals(0, r.getLegendItems().getItemCount());\n    dataset.addValue(1.0, \"S1\", \"C1\");\n    LegendItemCollection lic = r.getLegendItems();\n    assertEquals(1, lic.getItemCount());\n    assertEquals(\"S1\", lic.get(0).getLabel());\n}",
